(TCPC length-aware T4 new-location continuation after Attempt-6 sequence 23.)
(Dedicated campaign 2026082701 mode 41 attempt 7; model revision 2026082601.)
(No WCS changes. No G43/G49 changes. TCPC must already be ON.)

(Operator setup:)
(1. Start at active G54 work X0 Y0 Z0, absolute X2501.941254485,)
(   Y696.899347451 Z-280.866128272, B0/C0, with T4/H4 and G43.4.)
(2. Reset or reseat the probe. Confirm the laser is OFF. Manually deflect the)
(   probe twice, confirm both releases, then observe 30 seconds quiet.)
(3. Launch only the dedicated revision-2026082601 validation INI. The)
(   coefficient bank is startup-only and must not be sourced or reloaded.)
(4. Keep hand on feed hold/stop for the full continuation run.)
(5. This exact file is frozen to mode 41, campaign 2026082701, attempt 7.)
(6. Composite ownership is Attempt 4 accepted rows 1-9, Attempt 6 accepted)
(   rows 10-23, and Attempt 7 rows 24-101. Attempt 6's incomplete sequence-24)
(   contact and gap traces are diagnostic only and are excluded.)
(7. Attempt 7 reacquires all eight contacts of sequence 24. It does not reuse)
(   the incomplete Attempt-6 top contact. Attempt-4 centers remain immutable)
(   references only for the established 0.100 mm continuity checks.)
(8. Base-to-sphere is X+ Y- Z+; sphere-to-base/post is X- Y+ Z-.)
(9. Run only after configuration, program, pose, hash, and trajectory)
(   reachability preflight passes.)
(10. This runner installs frozen T4 #3032=0.154742 before probing.)
(11. Outside-G38 matched raw/mux activity with zero gated delta is diagnostic,)
(   never count-fatal. At the next stationary point it starts a 15.0 second)
(   continuous quiet window; each new edge resets that window. All episodes in)
(   one contact or gap context share a 900.0 second cumulative hard limit.)
(   Any outside-G38 gated edge remains fatal.)
(12. Each pose uses W, the sign-aware upper U side, -V, and +V.)
(13. Low B adds C45/C225. B30 and higher use C quadrants. C135/C315)
(   remain excluded known collision sectors near the post.)
(14. At the sole M0, reconfirm laser OFF and observe another continuously)
(   quiet 30-second interval. There is no unconditional pre-run quiet dwell;)
(   detected hold/resume chatter invokes the same automatic quiet policy.)
(15. There is one initial M0, no pre-M0 motion, no other hold, and no retry.)
(   The first move is the reviewed 1.425669 mm path to the center-derived)
(   Attempt-6 sequence-23 B0/C0 top-clear. The standard safe pattern then)
(   lifts 25 mm in Z, indexes B10/C0, positions XY, and lowers to top-clear.)
(16. A clean continuation writes 78 result/state/model-state rows, 25 closures,)
(   and 624 contact plus 624 gap trace rows.)
(17. True Attempt-7 same-run closures retain the 0.050 mm hard limit.)
(   Cross-attempt Attempt-4 continuity checks use a distinct 0.100 mm limit.)
(18. There is no fixed post-retract G4 P10/P15 dwell. A normal contact waits)
(   only for the existing 10.0 second ignore window and valid release. Chatter)
(   invokes the automatic stationary quiet window and resumes without M0.)
(19. The final stationary observation saw matched raw/mux counters rise from)
(   1259 to 1283 in bursts over roughly 50 seconds while gated held at 618,)
(   then remain quiet after 08:40:28. The finite quiet policy lets that matched)
(   gate-closed behavior settle; it never permits a gated repeat.)

